# Changelog

Update [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md) when shipping a user-visible **feature** or **fix**.

## When to update

- **Yes:** new features, bug fixes, breaking changes, notable behavior changes visible to users
- **No:** refactors, internal-only changes, dependency bumps, contributor-only rule/doc updates (unless they change how others work on the repo)

## Format

Follow [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/). Add bullets under `[Unreleased]` using:

- `### Added`
- `### Changed`
- `### Fixed`
- `### Removed`

Use **past tense** for entries. One concise bullet per change.

Example:

```markdown
## [Unreleased]

### Added
- Stash and reapply local changes when starting work on a branch

### Fixed
- Skip redundant issue refetch when switching back to an open webview tab
```

Do not edit plan files in `.cursor/plans/`.
